From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GDmio <zhalin66@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 00:14:05 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 13/32] BlueOS: SystemUI: Battery and music widgets

Two home screen widgets in the system palette colors (accent, dark theme):
- Battery (2x2): phone charge ring, charging bolt, connected Bluetooth
  headphones' charge. Follows ACTION_BATTERY_CHANGED, pushing only when the
  level or the plug state changes.
- Music (3x2): the playing (else most recent) media session of any app: art,
  title, artist, progress (ticks every 5 s while playing and the screen is
  on), previous / play-pause / next; tap opens the player.
SystemUI hosts them because it always runs and may read and control all media
sessions (MEDIA_CONTENT_CONTROL).

Change-Id: I3c60fd19639734d7e22fe0b3b8a6e706d8440d2e
